window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>All it took was one look to end my life...</b><br> <br> Because one look is all it takes to trigger a werewolf's mate hunt.<br> <br> And when a wolf is hunting, he doesn't stop until his mate either dies or becomes a wolf too.<br> <br> Now I'm trapped in some guy's house, he's stuck in his wolf form, and there's no way out for either of us.<br> <br> Life as I knew it is over, but my fight to survive is only beginning.<br> <br> <i>*This boxed set contains three full-length steamy paranormal romance standalones titled </i>Tested by the Alpha<i>, </i>Tempted by the Wolf<i>, and </i>Tolerated by the Sigma<i>. They are books 5-7 in the best-selling Mate Hunt series by Lola Glass.</i></p>"; 
